<p class="footnote">Kocherlakota, Narayana. 2011b. &ldquo;<a href="/speeches/2011/making-monetary-policy-public-contingency-planning-using-a-mandate-dashboard">Making Monetary Policy: Public Contingency Planning Using a Mandate Dashboard</a>.&rdquo; Speech at Stanford Institute for Economic Policy Research. Stanford, Calif.,  Nov. 29.</p>
<p class="footnote">Werning, Iv&aacute;n. 2012. &ldquo;<a href="http://economics.mit.edu/faculty/iwerning/papers">Managing a  Liquidity Trap: Monetary and Fiscal Policy</a>.&rdquo; Working paper. Massachusetts  Institute of Technology. </p>
